14674 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Right now\054 when the wind blows too hard\054 the grid panics and shuts the turbines down\056 We literally throw away 30\045 of our power\056 The answer isn\047t building massive\054 expensive batteries\073 it\031s using the \047batteries\047 already in our homes\056 By syncing smart boilers and appliances to turn on exactly when the wind surges\054 we stop wasting energy and start storing it as hot water and charged cars\056 We aren\047t asking people to use less\073 we\031re just asking them to use it when it\031s free\056)
