  << /ActualText (As of 2025\054 roughly 31\045 of households are classed as being in fuel poverty\056 These households spend more than 10\045 of their income on heating\056 This is higher than the Scottish average of 24\045\056 The number of households spending over \2432\054500 annually on electricity has quadrupled since 2019\056 \050European Marine Energy Centre\054 2024\051)
