14838 0 obj
  << /ActualText (To understand the scale of the opportunity\054 we first have to look at the generation gap\056\nOn the right\054 you see our Potential Grid Generation\072 170 Gigawatt\055hours\056 This is what Orkney is capable of producing with its wind resources\056 However\054 on the left\054 you see our current reality\056 Due to curtailment we are only able to absorb 144 GWh\056\n\nThe red margin you see there represents 25\0563 GWh of Energy Curtailed\056 That is clean\054 green energy that we are literally throwing away every single year because we have nowhere to put it\056 This gap is the fundamental \047fuel\047 for our Demand Response strategy\056)
     /K [ 13 ]
     /P 14839 0 R
     /Pg 7444 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

