  << /ActualText (We are diverting 20\045 of the system value into a community fund\056\nThis ensures those in fuel poverty who can\047t host high\055flex hardware still benefit from the project\056 It also improves community trust in th project\056\nThe Con\072 It slightly dilutes the direct financial \042hook\042 for the early adopters who are providing the most flexibility\056 Though the small amount of money that they miss out on is unlikely to be significant enough for them to opt out of the scheme\056)
