  << /ActualText (We are opting for automated intervention \050Kaluza controlling assets\051 rather than asking people to manually change their habits\056\nThis leads to much higher reliability and \042soak\042 potential because the algorithm\057system doesn\047t get tired or forget to turn on the dishwasher\056\nThe Con\072 It reduces the \042educational\042 aspect of the project\056 Residents might save money without actually learning why or becoming more energy\055literate\054 making them reliant on the software rather than mindful consumption\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 15068 0 R
